---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceHttpCookie
---@field ttl? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.Duration Lifetime of the cookie.
---@field name? string Name of the cookie.
---@field path? string Path to set for the cookie.

---Identity-Aware Proxy
