---@field oauth2ClientInfo? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceIAPOAuth2ClientInfo [Input Only] OAuth client info required to generate client id to be used for IAP.

---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceIAPOAuth2ClientInfo
