---@field clientName? string Name of the client to be generated. Optional - If not provided, the name will be autogenerated by the backend.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceIpAddressSelectionPolicyEnum "IPV4_ONLY"|"IPV6_ONLY"|"IP_ADDRESS_SELECTION_POLICY_UNSPECIFIED"|"PREFER_IPV6"

---Contains a list of BackendService resources.
