---The available logging options for the load balancer traffic served by this
---backend service.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceLogConfig
---@field sampleRate? number This field can only be specified if logging is enabled for this backend service. The value of the field must be in [0, 1]. This configures the sampling rate of requests to the load balancer where 1.0 means all logged requests are reported and 0.0 means no logged requests are reported. The default value is 1.0.
---@field optionalFields? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList This field can only be specified if logging is enabled for this backend service and "logConfig.optionalMode" was set to CUSTOM. Contains a list of optional fields you want to include in the logs. For example: serverInstance, serverGkeDetails.cluster, serverGkeDetails.pod.podNamespace
---@field loggingHttpResponseHeaders? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceLogConfigLoggingHttpHeaderList The list of response headers that will be logged to Stackdriver.
---@field optionalMode? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceLogConfigOptionalModeEnum|string This field can only be specified if logging is enabled for this backend service. Configures whether all, none or a subset of optional fields should be added to the reported logs. One of [INCLUDE_ALL_OPTIONAL, EXCLUDE_ALL_OPTIONAL, CUSTOM]. Default is EXCLUDE_ALL_OPTIONAL.
---@field loggingHttpRequestHeaders? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceLogConfigLoggingHttpHeaderList The list of request headers that will be logged to Stackdriver.
---@field enable? boolean Denotes whether to enable logging for the load balancer traffic served by this backend service. The default value is false.
---@field optional? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BackendServiceLogConfigOptionalEnum|string Deprecated in favor of optionalMode. This field can only be specified if logging is enabled for this backend service. Configures whether all, none or a subset of optional fields should be added to the reported logs. One of [INCLUDE_ALL_OPTIONAL, EXCLUDE_ALL_OPTIONAL, CUSTOM]. Default is EXCLUDE_ALL_OPTIONAL.

