---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BfdPacket
---@field length? number The length of the BFD Control packet in bytes. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field minRxIntervalMs? number The Required Min RX Interval value in the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field demand? boolean The demand bit of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field state? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BfdPacketStateEnum The current BFD session state as seen by the transmitting system. These states are specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field yourDiscriminator? number The Your Discriminator value in the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field poll? boolean The Poll bit of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field diagnostic? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BfdPacketDiagnosticEnum The diagnostic code specifies the local system's reason for the last change in session state. This allows remote systems to determine the reason that the previous session failed, for example. These diagnostic codes are specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field multiplier? number The detection time multiplier of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field final? boolean The Final bit of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field minTxIntervalMs? number The Desired Min TX Interval value in the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field minEchoRxIntervalMs? number The Required Min Echo RX Interval value in the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field authenticationPresent? boolean The Authentication Present bit of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field myDiscriminator? number The My Discriminator value in the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field version? number The version number of the BFD protocol, as specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880.
---@field controlPlaneIndependent? boolean The Control Plane Independent bit of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880
---@field multipoint? boolean The multipoint bit of the BFD packet. This is specified in section 4.1 ofRFC5880

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.BfdPacketDiagnosticEnum "ADMINISTRATIVELY_DOWN"|"CONCATENATED_PATH_DOWN"|"CONTROL_DETECTION_TIME_EXPIRED"|"DIAGNOSTIC_UNSPECIFIED"|"ECHO_FUNCTION_FAILED"|"FORWARDING_PLANE_RESET"|"NEIGHBOR_SIGNALED_SESSION_DOWN"|"NO_DIAGNOSTIC"|"PATH_DOWN"|"REVERSE_CONCATENATED_PATH_DOWN"

