---@field type? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.ExchangedPeeringRouteTypeEnum The type of the peering route.
---@field destRange? string The destination range of the route.
---@field imported? boolean True if the peering route has been imported from a peer. The actual import happens if the field networkPeering.importCustomRoutes is true for this network, and networkPeering.exportCustomRoutes is true for the peer network, and the import does not result in a route conflict.

