---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of the resource. Alwayscompute#haController for HaControllers.
---@field failoverInitiation? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.HaControllerFailoverInitiationEnum Indicates how failover should be initiated.
---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] Creation timestamp in RFC3339 text format.

