---@field soleTenantOnly? boolean If true, this license can only be used on VMs on sole tenant nodes.
---@field requiredCoattachedLicenses? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Specifies the set of permissible coattached licenseCodes of licenses that satisfy the coattachment requirement of this license. At least one license from the set must be attached to the same disk or image as this license.
---@field requestId? string An optional request ID to identify requests. Specify a unique request ID so that if you must retry your request, the server will know to ignore the request if it has already been completed. For example, consider a situation where you make an initial request and the request times out. If you make the request again with the same request ID, the server can check if original operation with the same request ID was received, and if so, will ignore the second request. This prevents clients from accidentally creating duplicate commitments. The request ID must be a valid UUID with the exception that zero UUID is not supported (00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000).
---@field project string Project ID for this request.

---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InsertMachineImagesRequest
---@field savedDisks? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SavedDiskList Output only. An array of Machine Image specific properties for disks attached to the source instance
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field sourceInstanceProperties? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SourceInstanceProperties Output only. [Output Only] DEPRECATED: Please use instance_properties instead for source instance related properties. New properties will not be added to this field.
---@field instanceProperties? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InstanceProperties [Output Only] Properties of source instance
---@field description? string An optional description of this resource. Provide this property when you create the resource.
