---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] Creation timestamp inRFC3339 text format.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SnapshotGroupStatusEnum|string Output only. [Output Only]
---@field description? string Optional. An optional description of this resource. Provide this property when you create the resource.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of the resource. Alwayscompute#snapshotGroup for SnapshotGroup resources.
---@field sourceInstantSnapshotGroup? string Input field for the source instant snapshot group.
---@field selfLinkWithId? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined URL for this resource's resource id.
