---@field type? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SslCertificateTypeEnum|string (Optional) Specifies the type of SSL certificate, either "SELF_MANAGED" or "MANAGED". If not specified, the certificate is self-managed and the fieldscertificate and private_key are used.
