---can use it to configure default machine type of Compute Engine VM instances.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InstanceSettings
---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InstanceSettingsMetadata The metadata key/value pairs assigned to all the instances in the corresponding scope.
