---@field documentationLink? string Output only. [Output Only] The url of Google Cloud public documentation explaining this requirement. This is set for every type of requirement.
---@field blockerType? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilityIntendedCapabilityBlockersBlockerTypeEnum|string
---@field metros? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Metros used to explain this blocker in more detail. These are three-letter lowercase strings like "iad". A blocker like INCOMPATIBLE_METROS will specify the problematic metros in this field.
---@field explanation? string Output only. [Output Only] A human-readable explanation of this requirement and why it's not met. This is set for every type of requirement.
