---@field zones? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Zones used to explain this blocker in more detail. Zone names are "zone1" and/or "zone2".

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilityIntendedCapabilityBlockersBlockerTypeEnum "INCOMPATIBLE_METROS"|"NOT_AVAILABLE"|"NO_INTERCONNECTS"|"NO_INTERCONNECTS_IN_METRO_AND_ZONE"|"OTHER"|"UNSPECIFIED"

