---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilitySupportedSlaEnum "NO_SLA"|"PRODUCTION_CRITICAL"|"PRODUCTION_NON_CRITICAL"|"UNSPECIFIED"

