---@field defaultPort? number The default port used if the port number is not specified in the network endpoint. If the network endpoint type is either GCE_VM_IP,SERVERLESS or PRIVATE_SERVICE_CONNECT, this field must not be specified. [Deprecated] This field is deprecated.
---@field subnetwork? string Optional URL of the subnetwork to which all network endpoints in the NEG belong. [Deprecated] This field is deprecated.

