---@field networkTier? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.PublicAdvertisedPrefixNetworkTierEnum|string Network tier to be used for this prefix. All child delegated prefixes will inherit this field. If this field is not specified, it defaults to the network tier of the project that the PublicAdvertisedPrefix belongs to.
