---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.PatchPublicDelegatedPrefixesRequest
---@field ipv6AccessType? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.PublicDelegatedPrefixIpv6AccessTypeEnum|string Output only. [Output Only] The internet access type for IPv6 Public Delegated Prefixes. Inherited from parent prefix.
---@field mode? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.PublicDelegatedPrefixModeEnum|string The public delegated prefix mode for IPv6 only.
---@field byoipApiVersion? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.PublicDelegatedPrefixByoipApiVersionEnum|string Output only. [Output Only] The version of BYOIP API.
