---@field kind? string Output only. [Output only] Type of the resource. Alwayscompute#sslPolicyfor SSL policies.
---@field warnings? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SslPolicyWarningsItemList Output only. [Output Only] If potential misconfigurations are detected for this SSL policy, this field will be populated with warning messages.
---@field minTlsVersion? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SslPolicyMinTlsVersionEnum|string The minimum version of SSL protocol that can be used by the clients to establish a connection with the load balancer. This can be one ofTLS_1_0, TLS_1_1, TLS_1_2,TLS_1_3. When set to TLS_1_3, the profile field must be set to RESTRICTED.
