---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.PerInstanceConfig
---@field name? string The name of a per-instance configuration and its corresponding instance. Serves as a merge key during UpdatePerInstanceConfigs operations, that is, if a per-instance configuration with the same name exists then it will be updated, otherwise a new one will be created for the VM instance with the same name. An attempt to create a per-instance configuration for a VM instance that either doesn't exist or is not part of the group will result in an error.
