---@field licenses? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Any valid publicly visible licenses.
---@field storageBytes? string Output only. [Output Only] A size of the storage used by the disk's snapshot by this machine image.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SavedAttachedDiskTypeEnum|string Specifies the type of the attached disk, either SCRATCH orPERSISTENT.
---@field guestOsFeatures? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.GuestOsFeatureList A list of features to enable on the guest operating system. Applicable only for bootable images. Read Enabling guest operating system features to see a list of available options.
---@field boot? boolean Indicates that this is a boot disk. The virtual machine will use the first partition of the disk for its root filesystem.
---@field deviceName? string Specifies the name of the disk attached to the source instance.
---@field interface? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SavedAttachedDiskInterfaceEnum|string Specifies the disk interface to use for attaching this disk, which is either SCSI or NVME.
---@field index? number Output only. Specifies zero-based index of the disk that is attached to the source instance.
---@field diskEncryptionKey? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.CustomerEncryptionKey The encryption key for the disk.

