---@field destIpRanges? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Destination IPv4/IPv6 addresses or CIDR prefixes, in standard text format.
---@field srcAsns? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.IntegerList BGP Autonomous System Number associated with the source IP address.
---@field destPorts? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Destination port numbers for TCP/UDP/SCTP. Each element can be a 16-bit unsigned decimal number (e.g. "80") or range (e.g. "0-1023").

---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SecurityPolicyRuleNetworkMatcherUserDefinedFieldMatch
---@field values? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList Matching values of the field. Each element can be a 32-bit unsigned decimal or hexadecimal (starting with "0x") number (e.g. "64") or range (e.g. "0x400-0x7ff").
---@field name? string Name of the user-defined field, as given in the definition.

