---@field requestUrisToExclude? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.SecurityPolicyRulePreconfiguredWafConfigExclusionFieldParamsList A list of request URIs from the request line to be excluded from inspection during preconfigured WAF evaluation. When specifying this field, the query or fragment part should be excluded.
---@field targetRuleSet? string Target WAF rule set to apply the preconfigured WAF exclusion.
---@field targetRuleIds? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringList A list of target rule IDs under the WAF rule set to apply the preconfigured WAF exclusion. If omitted, it refers to all the rule IDs under the WAF rule set.

