---Represents a zonal storage pool resource.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StoragePool
---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] Creation timestamp inRFC3339 text format.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of the resource. Always compute#storagePool for storage pools.
---@field labelFingerprint? string A fingerprint for the labels being applied to this storage pool, which is essentially a hash of the labels set used for optimistic locking. The fingerprint is initially generated by Compute Engine and changes after every request to modify or update labels. You must always provide an up-to-date fingerprint hash in order to update or change labels, otherwise the request will fail with error412 conditionNotMet. To see the latest fingerprint, make a get() request to retrieve a storage pool.
---@field poolProvisionedIops? string Provisioned IOPS of the storage pool. Only relevant if the storage pool type is hyperdisk-balanced.
---@field provisionedThroughput? string DEPRECATED -- use "pool provisioned throughput".
---@field capacityProvisioningType? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StoragePoolCapacityProvisioningTypeEnum Provisioning type of the byte capacity of the pool.
---@field params? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StoragePoolParams Input only. Additional params passed with the request, but not persisted as part of resource payload.
