---@field shieldedVmConfig? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.ShieldedVmConfig Output only. Deprecating, please use shielded_instance_config.
---@field scheduling? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.Scheduling Sets the scheduling options for this instance.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.StringMap Labels to apply to this instance. These can be later modified by the setLabels method.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. [Output Only] Reserved for future use.
