---@field priority? number Optional. Priority of this policy. Used to resolve conflicts when multiple policies apply to the same extension. The policy priority is an integer from 0 to 65535, inclusive. Lower integers indicate higher priorities. If you do not specify a priority when creating a rule, it is assigned a priority of 1000. If priorities are equal, the policy with the most recent creation timestamp takes precedence.
