---Message for the expected URL mappings.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_alpha.UrlMapTest
---@field service? string Expected BackendService or BackendBucket resource the given URL should be mapped to. The service field cannot be set if expectedRedirectResponseCode is set.
---@field description? string Description of this test case.
